WEBVTT

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:30.358
sva ta vlažnost koja je ispunila ostatak
tijela

00:00:30.358 --> 00:00:32.102
naglo bi se vratila

00:00:32.102 --> 00:00:33.913
i hidrirala mozak

00:00:33.913 --> 00:00:36.459
i osvježila um.

00:00:36.459 --> 00:00:38.880
Nama to sada zvuči baš smiješno,

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:40.921
ali Galen je prosto pokušao da
objasni

00:00:40.921 --> 00:00:42.528
nešto vezano za san

00:00:42.528 --> 00:00:45.185
sa čime se susrećemo svaki dan.

00:00:45.185 --> 00:00:47.109
Na osnovu svog iskustva, svi znamo

00:00:47.109 --> 00:00:49.821
da nam san razbistruje um

00:00:49.821 --> 00:00:51.283
i nedostatak istog

00:00:51.283 --> 00:00:54.210
čini naš um mutnim.

00:00:54.210 --> 00:00:56.722
Iako se danas zna mnogo više o snu

00:00:56.722 --> 00:00:58.526
nego kad je Galen bio živ,

00:00:58.526 --> 00:01:01.406
još uvijek ne znamo zašto san